{% extends "_base.j2" %}
{% block body %}
Write a {{ target_words }}-word IEEE-style abstract for the survey
below. Cover: (1) scope and motivation, (2) taxonomy summary,
(3) highlighted trends/open challenges, (4) intended audience.

Domain: {{ domain.domain }}

Section summaries (first 300 characters each):
{% for s in sections %}
- {{ s.name }}: {{ (s.get('text') or "")[:300] | replace("\n", " ") }}
{% endfor %}

Rules:
* No headings, single paragraph.
* Do not introduce new claims beyond what the sections cover.
* Citations, if any, MUST be of the form ``[CITE:<corpus_key>]`` — but
  abstracts usually avoid citations; prefer to have none.
{% endblock %}
